{
  "about": "POST /credits/authorize: one credit for one line. Cases are the upstream unit test's literals: auth is the signed-fetch address the test injects (null = none), request.body the JSON body, response the asserted status/body. $any marks expect.any(...), $notAsserted a body the test does not pin; `rule` says what the handler computes there.",
